  "name": "Forbidden Light Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The first Build & Battle Box, which replaced the Prerelease Kits and, unlike them, was also sold in shops: given to players at the Forbidden Light prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 21–22 and 28–29 April 2018, and sold from 15 June 2018. Each box held four Forbidden Light booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Forbidden Light logo. The packs also held a non-holo Magnezone, a card that is holofoil in booster packs.",
